  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n# Dr. Richard H.\n\n\n\n# Ting\n\n\n\n###### DMD, MD\n\n\n\n### Training and Education\n\n\nResidency:\n\nUniversity of California, Los Angeles\n\nOral and Maxillofacial Surgery\n\nMedical School:\n\nDoctorate of Medicine\n\nDental School:\n\nUniversity of Southern California\n\nDoctor of Dental Surgery\n\nDr. Ting practices the full scope of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery. His practice predominantly consists of reconstructive dental implant cases and complex bone grafting procedures. He also has extensive experience in pathology and reconstruction in the Maxillofacial region.\n\nDr. Ting is the department chair of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery at Providence Saint John’s Health Center. Additionally, he is a Lecturer at UCLA’s department of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery. He serves as an examiner for General Anesthesia for the Dental Board of California.\n\nDr. Ting is a Diplomate of the American Board of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery. He maintains membership in multiple professional organizations including American Association of Oral and Maxillofacial Surgeons, American Medical Association, and the California Dental Association.\n\nHe is a Los Angeles native, and attended dental school at the University of Southern California, graduating with honors. After receiving his doctorate in dentistry, he continued his education at the University of California, Los Angeles earning his Medical degree. He also completed his residency training in Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery which included training in General surgery at UCLA.\n\n\n#### Dr. Howard H.\n\n\n\n#### Park\n\n\n\n###### Dr. Howard H.\n\n\n\n###### Park\n\n\n\n#### Dr. Gil B.\n\n\n\n#### Ivry\n\n\n\n###### Dr. Gil B.\n\n\n\n###### Ivry\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
